@startuml
' Agent lifecycle & MCP discovery - PlantUML
actor Developer
participant "csharp-mcp-server" as CSharp
participant "Brunella Core (Node)" as Core
participant "myai (Python)" as MyAI
participant "MCP Discovery" as MCP
database "agents/registry.json" as Registry

Developer -> CSharp: warmup (optional)
Developer -> Core: start dev server (npm run dev)
Core -> MyAI: start python subsystem
Core -> MCP: GET /_next/mcp or read mcp_servers.json
MCP -> Core: return available tools & ports
Core -> Registry: load agent metadata
Registry -> Core: provide agent entrypoint definitions
Core -> MCP: register and validate tools
Core -> Developer: emit "ready" event (tools loaded)

note over Core,MCP
  Runtime responsibilities:
  - MCP discovery, tool health checks
  - Agent lifecycle (start/stop/retry)
  - Sync registry metadata
end note
@enduml
